{"unit_id":"xalor888__dsh-unlimited-retry#card-zh","repo":"xalor888/dsh-unlimited-retry","commit":"6eb9794a7689cb1e25cb0a05fd5eb7867becc054","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unlimited-retry 是面向 DSH Web 和桌面客户端的模型请求重试插件，在 agent/request-error 恢复链末端处理此前未恢复的失败。它按指数退避并加入随机抖动，单次等待受上限约束；可配置最大尝试次数、排除的错误码，以及是否在提供方没有重试策略时继续尝试。插件还记录重试事件，并提供实时设置面板查看状态、编辑策略和管理计数器。适合希望长时间运行的 DSH 会话能从暂时性请求故障中恢复的用户；默认没有尝试次数上限，可在设置中设限。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1030-1095","index.js:407-412","client.js:37-80"]}
{"unit_id":"xalor888__dsh-unlimited-retry#card-en","repo":"xalor888/dsh-unlimited-retry","commit":"6eb9794a7689cb1e25cb0a05fd5eb7867becc054","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-unlimited-retry handles model request failures left by earlier DSH recovery layers. It retries with capped exponential backoff and jitter, supports attempt limits and excluded codes, records retry events, and offers a live settings panel.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1030-1095","index.js:407-412","client.js:37-80"]}
