{"unit_id":"xalor888__dsh-unlimited-retry#feature-1","repo":"xalor888/dsh-unlimited-retry","commit":"6eb9794a7689cb1e25cb0a05fd5eb7867becc054","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unlimited-retry 的功能「失败请求重试」：在更早的恢复层未处理失败时接手，按配置重新发起模型请求。可设定尝试次数上限，也可配置是否处理没有提供方重试策略的请求。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1030-1078","index.js:1089-1095"]}
{"unit_id":"xalor888__dsh-unlimited-retry#feature-2","repo":"xalor888/dsh-unlimited-retry","commit":"6eb9794a7689cb1e25cb0a05fd5eb7867becc054","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unlimited-retry 的功能「退避等待」：每次重试按指数增长计算等待时间，并加入抖动；延迟和提供方建议的等待时间都受 maxDelayMs 限制。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:407-412","index.js:1080-1087"]}
{"unit_id":"xalor888__dsh-unlimited-retry#feature-3","repo":"xalor888/dsh-unlimited-retry","commit":"6eb9794a7689cb1e25cb0a05fd5eb7867becc054","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unlimited-retry 的功能「策略设置面板」：在 DSH 设置页查看重试状态、次数和最近记录，并修改策略、失败码及计数器；更改通过配置编辑服务保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:37-80","index.js:1248-1274"]}
{"unit_id":"xalor888__dsh-unlimited-retry#feature-4","repo":"xalor888/dsh-unlimited-retry","commit":"6eb9794a7689cb1e25cb0a05fd5eb7867becc054","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unlimited-retry 的功能「可取消的重试等待」：等待期间监听请求与插件生命周期的取消信号；若等待被取消，不会继续发送该次重试。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:970-1027"]}
{"unit_id":"xalor888__dsh-unlimited-retry#caveat-1","repo":"xalor888/dsh-unlimited-retry","commit":"6eb9794a7689cb1e25cb0a05fd5eb7867becc054","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-unlimited-retry 使用前须知：默认不限制重试次数，若请求持续失败会继续尝试；可设置 maxAttempts 或排除终止错误码来约束行为。（见 cordis.patch.yml:8-18、index.js:26-30）","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:8-18","index.js:26-30"]}
